{"author":{"id":"609bf866d4a5d716c19faf5d617b3bf3de478230d29602d72aad5aa90a80466f"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1790292734,"nonce":"v86/HWp6hcjrioPpsSPFuIFr0MU=","title":"redundant-guard-elim leaves a phi arm for the edge it removes when the target stays reachable","message":"`ash --mode jit test_string_order.hl` (corpus) dies with \"JIT tier 0 failed\nto compile findex 255\": AIR verify refuses the function after O3, \"b14:\nphi v30 arity 3 but block has 2 predecessors\". `air_refusals --level O3`\nnames the pass: redundant-guard-elim broke the IR. Hybrid and interp pass\nonly because the function stays interpreted.\n\nThe pass folds a decided CondJump to a Jump. The block the dropped edge\nled to kept that edge's arm in its phis; prune_unreachable drops arms only\nfor blocks that became unreachable, and here the target (a loop join) is\nstill reached from the taken arm.","files":null}]}